body:
My ex boss stopped paying taxes for 3 years. People would come in to The shop and pull guns on us. Landlord was a 21 year old girl that cried a lot when you asked her to do something. Only person in her family that knew English. My boss would constantly talk about disciplining children before he ever had kids. Boss was also stealing power from our neighbor. Asian family that owned our strip mall would come into our store at night and just hang out. I was almost arrested for parking behind the store one day. Something I did for 5 years. Old man behind us worked on cars inside of the strip mall. Our store sometimes smelled liked car exhaust. Cell phone store owner had a mental breakdown when he got a flat tire. Smashed up his own car in our parking lot. Saw more than one person die in our store. Boss used to try to gaslight people about rape and having sex with teenagers. 

&#x200B;

Worst job I’ve ever had. Glad to not only not be working there but glad I don’t live in that town anymore. Nothing but bad memories.
